      "summary": "Solventum Corporation (SOLV) received FDA 510(k) clearance for combining its Restrata Synthetic Electrospun Fiber Matrix with V.A.C. Therapy for advanced wound care. The clearance strengthens SOLV's competitive position in the advanced wound care market, which is projected to reach $19.32 billion by 2030. The combined therapy may reduce dressing changes, streamline workflows, and support recurring revenue growth, though commercial impact depends on market adoption.",
